((date 2026-11-15) (slug gate-funnel-p1)
 (hypothesis
  "Gate funnel P1 (axis observatory, pre-registered in dev/experiments/gate-funnel-2026-11-15/README.md at 47b7c476a, #3628). One 26y diagnostic cell = record config S k0 + --emit-candidates on the new candidate-log fields (#3625/#3626: rank, walk, shadow, tickets_placed, long_cash_left_pct, long_resting_reserved_pct). Rule 1 (gate before cap): X = sum over free-cash Fridays of min(crowded-out shadow-Buyable cut names, floor(free / m)); CLOSE if X net * f < 25; else REFINE: BUILD only if X ref * f >= 40 and C* mean capped ride >= funded - 1 pp and the bear years' (2000-02 + 2008) share of X ref <= their share of open Fridays + 10 pp; else PARK. Rule 2 (score against outcome, first read after the #2380 RS fix): RANKING LEVER if A+ beats A by >= 2 pp mean capped ride in both halves and >= 1.3x monster rate; UNDERPOWERED below 100 rows or 20 monsters per half; else NO RANKING LEVER. Prior: CLOSE.")
 (base_scenario
  "gate-funnel-2026-11-15: gf-S-k0-s0 at GF_SHA 47b7c476a, image ghcr.io/dayfine/trading-ci:latest, warehouse v12wk-9236 + corpact-2026-10-27 + bars data-20261102, one Claude cloud session launched 2026-11-15 06:48Z; TRIPWIRE MATCH (trades.csv md5 0928cfe4, 577 lines) and PARITY identical to #3602 S-k0 on every artifact; SK1-SK3 PASS; V6 INVARIANT PASS; n_symbols_absent=1. Price-bearing files in the private dayfine/trading-results at a3a2dadc2, same path.")
