  (((label gf-S-k0-s0) (config_hash seeded-k0-emit-candidates@47b7c476a) (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.6338) (mean_calmar 0.4028) (mean_return_pct 1472.76) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 27.22)))))))
 (verdict Inconclusive)
 (notes
  "Rule 1 PARK, Rule 2 NO RANKING LEVER; nothing built. Rule 1: m 0.0857, f 0.8507, s 0.0241; X gross/net/ref 3,130/1,411/1,409.8; X net*f 1,200.3 (48x the CLOSE bar; prior CLOSE half wrong); X ref*f 1,199.2 >= 40 met; C* net +3.97 % (n 880) vs funded +4.90 % (n 616) met by 0.07 pp; bear share of X ref 0.260 vs 0.149 NOT met; path-aware X net 181. Rule 2: A+ - A +0.73 / -0.14 pp, monsters 6.5 vs 6.1 % = 1.07x. WHY: X is the empty-book state after the macro gate or stops cleared the book: 52 % of X net on 74 zero-position Fridays, 90 % within 26 open Fridays of a Bearish read; top 5 of 30 episodes 60 % (2009, 2022-23, 2016, 2003, 2001-02). There the top 20 is 96 % A+ and 94 % No_structural_stop (fresh highs lack a post-high dip >= 8 % within 15 %); buyable share rises down the ranking (2 % at 1-20 to 13 % past 200; the rank-band figures are ad hoc over the private pool table); zero cash skips. Invested state (744/1,099 open Fridays at 6+ positions) is cash-bound, as the 09-22 read said. C*'s ride tie is 2003 (+31.3 %, 83 % of C*'s ride sum; without it -3.8 pp; leave-one-year-out fails 7/21); bear years -3.1 %. Stop_too_wide never fires under require_structural_stop: the structural-stop and width gates are one gate. FORWARD: keep gate-before-cap as PARK, unqueued; P3 leads max_stop_distance_pct 12/15/18 read around reopen episodes by regime; cap 40 low; ranking dials low; pre-regs read pooled outcome clauses leave-one-year-out and count X path-aware. Writeup: dev/experiments/gate-funnel-2026-11-15/README.md Results."))
